{"metadata":{"title":"Events","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"symbolKind":"module","externalID":"Events"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema\/Enumeration","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent"],"anchor":"Events"},{"title":"Property values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refinement","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Constraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ValidationKeyword","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/UnsatisfiedConstraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidConstraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConstraintViolation"],"anchor":"Property-values"},{"title":"Records","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SourceLocation","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey"],"anchor":"Records"},{"title":"Stores","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"],"anchor":"Stores"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An event is a value that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", declared with ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Its stored properties","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are its properties, so a misspelled or mistyped one is a compile error. Its type gives the name","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destinations record it under, the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" whose consent decides whether it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivered, and the version of its shape. Each has a default: the type’s name,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory\/analytics","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two property types carry rules of their own. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"text":" value, such as an email address,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints as ","type":"text"},{"code":"<redacted>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and has no public accessor: a destination reads it through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/reveal(_:)"},{"text":", which gives ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once a delivery has redacted the record. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined"},{"text":" value satisfies every ","type"